Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,必得「小猫乔治」盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:07.23,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\frx2\fry0\frz40.11\pos(449.334,384)}小
